{
  "quest.4DF28E7685DA9FF4.title": "Meshes",
  "quest.3E8578DF505AD27F.quest_desc": [
    "There a various ways to generate bucks. You can make bucks from &lMolten Copper&r, &lMolten Brass&r and &lMolten Bronze&r as well as selling a lot of different items ",
